title: The Coallition Affairs
subtitle: Spend to cool factional dissent, or pull the snap-election lever.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 160
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_coalition_affairs_timer <= 0 and (internal_dissent >= 20 or government_coalition_dissent >= 8 or early_election_risk >= 30 or left_in_government = 1)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_coalition_affairs_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/coalition-council.webp

= The Coallition Affairs

Every coalition is two fights at once: what to pass, and who pays the political
cost. We can spend organisational capacity to cool the room, or gamble on an
early parliamentary vote that punishes the governing bloc and feeds the
extremes.

- @stabilise
- @snap

@stabilise
title: Spend 1 resource on a coalition-calming package
subtitle: Reduce internal and coalition dissent without changing the budget line.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: One resource is required for whips, caucus meetings and public discipline.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; internal_dissent -= 8; government_coalition_dissent -= 6; party_unity += 2; public_trust += 1; barons_dissent -= 1; spring_dissent -= 1; labor_dissent -= 1; progressives_dissent -= 1; razem_dissent -= 1; social_patriot_dissent -= 1; news_headline = "A coalition-calming package lowers visible dissent"

The room is not harmonious, but deadlines are again negotiable and every
caucus leaves with fewer reasons to defect this month.

- #poland_card_finish

@snap
title: Force self-dissolution and open a snap election
subtitle: Immediate election campaign; government polling takes a hit and the radical right gets a boost.
on-arrival: {! 
Q.snap_election_requested = 0;
Q.snap_election_request_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.snap_election_request_year = Number(Q.year) || 0;
Q.snap_election_request_month = Number(Q.month) || 0;
Q.snap_election_reason = "Coalition-affairs snap election";
Q.snap_election_trigger = "Coalition-affairs self-dissolution vote";
Q.snap_self_dissolution_support = 307;
Q.position = "Snap-election campaign";
Q.coalition_status = "Self-dissolution after coalition affairs showdown";
Q.early_election_risk = 100;
Q.public_trust -= 3;
Q.left_poll -= 1.0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    Q.pis_poll -= 2.0;
} else {
    Q.ko_poll -= 1.4;
    Q.psl_poll -= 0.4;
    Q.p2050_poll -= 0.4;
}
Q.konf_poll += 1.2;
Q.konf_vote_intent += 1.2;
Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.40;
Q.korona_poll += 0.4;
Q.korona_vote_intent += 0.4;
Q.far_right_agenda += 5;
Q.news_headline = "Coalition affairs ends in self-dissolution and a snap-election campaign";
!}
go-to: poland_events_2026.snap_campaign_launch
